<title>RUSSIA: Russia to transfer Rostelekom stake to Svyazinvest.</title>
<headline>Russia to transfer Rostelekom stake to Svyazinvest.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian government plans to transfer its entire 38 percent stake (51 percent of the votes) in national phone company Rostelekom  to state telecoms holding company Svyazinvest, a privatisation ministry spokesman said on Friday.</p>
<p>A stake in the newly merged company will then be offered to portfolio investors rather than to a single strategic investor, Igor Plotnikov, spokesman of the State Property Committee, told Reuters.</p>
</text>
